      "raw": "<p>Yes, the kraken can target villains as they are not Environment targets. The Kraken finds minions very tasty, apparently.</p><p>Dpends what you mean by stack. If you have two Phosphorescent Chambers, then that will be +2 damage dealt, +2 HP recovery. If you have two The Krakens, then each would attack the lowest HP target at the time, which may be different if the first The Kraken kills one, for 5 melee damage each rather than one target for 10 melee damage. Cards that don&#39;t have the same name also stack. The exceptiobn is Limited cards as you can only have one of those in play at a time.</p><p>That depends on the card. If it targets multiple targets at once (Greivous Hail Storm, Holy Nova) or specifically says another target (Grenade Launcher, Hoarfire) then they can&#39;t be the same thing. If you have a card that says &quot;target 1 rtarget, then target 1 target&quot; (such as Schirezo of Frost and Flame) they can be the same target. The last one is really unusual though, so most of the time the answer will be &quot;No&quot;.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
