      "created_at": "2012-11-12T20:33:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Had a question about this myself \"<span>Dpends what you mean by stack. If you have two Phosphorescent Chambers, then that will be +2 damage dealt, +2 HP recovery.\"</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>on the HP recovery - does that mean that everyone starts recovering HP? &nbsp;I didn't think so. I assume it means if something happens that causes a player or villain to recover hp, an additional 2 points are added. &nbsp;Still a very new player, so haven't really had an instance where someone was recovering HP. &nbsp;Unless I am missing out on some rule or something that states heroes are supposed to recover HP at certain points, but I read the rule-book a few times at didn't see such a rule.</span></p>",
