      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Had a question about this myself &quot;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;\">Dpends what you mean by stack. If you have two Phosphorescent Chambers, then that will be +2 damage dealt, +2 HP recovery.&quot;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;\">on the HP recovery - does that mean that everyone starts recovering HP? &nbsp;I didn&#39;t think so. I assume it means if something happens that causes a player or villain to recover hp, an additional 2 points are added. &nbsp;Still a very new player, so haven&#39;t really had an instance where someone was recovering HP. &nbsp;Unless I am missing out on some rule or something that states heroes are supposed to recover HP at certain points, but I read the rule-book a few times at didn&#39;t see such a rule.</span></p>",
